{"pages":[{"w":612.0,"h":792.0,"s":[[13.889,2.206,18.17,3.8,3.431,"EQUINOX"],[13.889,5.306,14.953,1.205,1.078,"Q U A N T I T A T I V E"],[69.444,2.807,14.011,1.643,1.471,"US Equity Research"],[69.444,4.27,11.266,1.46,1.307,"19 November 2026"],[13.889,10.995,15.328,3.651,3.268,"Anthropic"],[13.889,14.731,33.136,2.373,2.124,"IPO initiation: real growth, rich price"],[13.889,20.845,52.951,1.809,1.634,"Anthropic priced its IPO at $83 on 18 November, above the $70-78 range,"],[13.889,22.289,52.951,1.809,1.634,"selling 956m new shares for $79.4bn beside a $26.0bn placement with Google,"],[13.889,23.733,52.931,1.809,1.634,"NVIDIA and five other suppliers. Trading starts today. On 18.14bn fully diluted"],[13.889,25.177,52.931,1.809,1.634,"shares the offer values the equity at $1.51tn and, net of $232bn of cash, the"],[13.889,26.621,52.931,1.809,1.634,"business at $1.27tn: 15.7x the $81bn run-rate revenue of 31 October and 10.2x"],[13.889,28.065,52.934,1.809,1.634,"our 2027E revenue. We start at Underweight, Dec-27 target $55. On our"],[13.889,29.509,52.308,1.809,1.634,"margins and method, $83 needs 2030E revenue of $474bn; we forecast $287bn."],[13.889,31.995,52.931,1.809,1.634,"The growth is real: quarterly revenue rose from $1.4bn to $17.0bn in a year, and"],[13.889,33.439,52.931,1.809,1.634,"customers paying over $100,000 from 950 to 11,900. Compute is the limit. Q3"],[13.889,34.883,52.931,1.809,1.634,"adjusted operating margin fell to 15% from 19% as $5.0bn of premium-priced"],[13.889,36.328,52.934,1.809,1.634,"short-term compute lifted compute to 58% of revenue (Q2: 48%) and price cuts"],[13.889,37.772,52.964,1.809,1.634,"cost $600m. Commitments total $901bn, $452bn before 2031. We assume run-"],[13.889,39.216,52.931,1.809,1.634,"rate revenue adds $4bn a month to December and $6bn a month in 2027"],[13.889,40.684,52.951,1.809,1.634,"(October added $10bn): revenue of $53.7bn in 2026E and $125bn in 2027E,"],[13.889,42.128,52.931,1.809,1.634,"then growth of 45%, 30% and 22% to 2030E, with adjusted operating margin"],[13.889,43.572,41.309,1.809,1.634,"reaching 30% and stock pay on new grants at 5-7% of revenue."],[13.889,46.034,52.964,1.809,1.634,"Our target averages two methods: 17.9x, the median forward P/E of six AI-"],[13.889,47.502,52.936,1.809,1.634,"platform peers, on 2030E earnings plus cash gives $59; a DCF at an 11.8% cost"],[13.889,48.946,52.934,1.809,1.634,"of equity gives $53. Our bull case (2030E revenue $370bn, 34% margin) gives"],[13.889,50.39,52.987,1.809,1.634,"$77, still below the offer. We would be wrong if revenue grows 56% a year from"],[13.889,51.834,52.966,1.809,1.634,"2027E to 2030E (we model 32%) or adjusted margin reaches 44% (we model"],[13.889,53.278,52.931,1.809,1.634,"30%). Other risks: a trust elects most of the board and the co-founders hold"],[13.889,54.722,52.931,1.809,1.634,"50.1% of votes; the Department of War’s supply-chain designation stands after a"],[13.889,56.167,49.98,1.809,1.634,"2-1 appeal ruling; 3.7bn shares can be sold before the 180-day lock-up ends."],[13.889,58.654,17.493,1.643,1.471,"Quarterly Revenue ($ bn)"],[15.268,67.013,0.509,1.022,0.915,"0"],[15.268,65.648,0.509,1.022,0.915,"5"],[14.777,64.285,0.999,1.022,0.915,"10"],[14.777,62.921,0.999,1.022,0.915,"15"],[14.777,61.558,0.999,1.022,0.915,"20"],[14.777,60.195,0.999,1.022,0.915,"25"],[16.263,67.753,2.27,0.949,0.85,"Q1 25"],[19.335,67.753,1.126,0.949,0.85,"Q2"],[21.819,67.753,1.126,0.949,0.85,"Q3"],[24.318,67.753,1.126,0.949,0.85,"Q4"],[26.231,67.753,2.27,0.949,0.85,"Q1 26"],[29.302,67.753,1.126,0.949,0.85,"Q2"],[31.786,67.753,1.126,0.949,0.85,"Q3"],[34.041,67.753,1.711,0.949,0.85,"Q4E"],[19.894,68.894,3.57,1.275,1.111,"Revenue"],[26.225,68.894,5.523,1.275,1.111,"Compute cost"],[13.889,70.054,9.613,1.387,1.209,"Range | offer price ($)"],[31.995,70.054,4.442,1.387,1.209,"70-78 | 83"],[13.889,71.143,14.362,1.387,1.209,"Shares: new | selling holders (m)"],[32.884,71.143,3.554,1.387,1.209,"956 | 24"],[13.889,72.208,13.535,1.387,1.20